ht,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">DESIGNING SPACES.<br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
DEFINING SYSTEMS.</span></span></span></h4></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-m42xm30v" class="ku3DBC zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx comp-m42xm30v wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h4 class="font_4 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:20px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:20px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,avenir-lt-w05_35-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Swiss Innovation and Design since 1983</span></span></span></h4></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-ljwzpefr" class="ku3DBC zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx comp-ljwzpefr wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:30px; text-align:justify;"><span style="font-size:30px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text">WOGG steht f&uuml;r Schweizer Pr&auml;zision, innovative Entwicklung und zeitlose Gestaltung.</span></span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:30px; text-align:justify;"><span style="font-size:30px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:30px; text-align:justify;"><span style="font-size:30px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text">In Zusammenarbeit mit international renommierten Designerinnen und Designern sowie Ingenieurinnen und Ingenieuren entstehen M&ouml;bel und Systeme, die R&auml;ume strukturieren und Architektur erg&auml;nzen.</span></span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:30px; text-align:justify;"><span style="font-size:30px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:30px; text-align:justify;"><span style="font-size:30px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text">Heute entwickelt WOGG diese Haltung weiter - mit technologisch wegweisenden Systemen, neuen Partnerschaften und einem internationalen Netzwerk -&nbsp; dem neuen WOGG Circle.</span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-mnbhwr8a" class="comp-mnbhwr8a CohWsy wixui-column-strip"><div id="bgLayers_comp-mnbhwr8a" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-mnbhwr8a" class="if7Vw2"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="tcElKx i1tH8h"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-mnbhwr8a" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-mnbhwr8a" class="wG8dni"></div></div><div data-testid="columns" class="V5AUxf"><!--$--><div id="comp-mnbhwr8x1" class="comp-mnbhwr8x1 YzqVVZ wixui-column-strip__column"><div id="bgLayers_comp-mnbhwr8x1" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-mnbhwr8x1" class="MW5IWV"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LWbAav Kv1aVt"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-mnbhwr8x1" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-mnbhwr8x1" class="VgO9Yg"><wow-image id="img_comp-mnbhwr8x1" class="jhxvbR Kv1aVt dLPlxY mNGsUM bgImage" data-image-info="{&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mnbhwr8x1&quot;,&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;bottom&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;,&quot;targetWidth&quot;:980,&quot;targetHeight&quot;:500,&quot;isLQIP&quot;:true,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:1280,&quot;height&quot;:720,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;0d526f_1a40fef60d9147a0b3695c703042d32e~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;,&quot;hasAnimation&quot;:false}}" data-motion-part="BG_IMG comp-mnbhwr8x1" data-bg-effect-name="" data-has-ssr-src="true"><img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/0d526f_1a40fef60d9147a0b3695c703042d32e~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_133,h_75,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,blur_2,enc_avif,quality_auto/0d526f_1a40fef60d9147a0b3695c703042d32e~mv2.jpg" alt="W79_3er_Gruppe2.jpg" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 100%" width="980" height="500"/></wow-image></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-mnbhwr8x1inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-mnbhwr8x1inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"></div></div></div><!--/$--></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-mnbhyj0m" class="ku3DBC zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx comp-mnbhyj0m wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:30px; text-align:center;"><span style="letter-spacing:0.9em;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:30px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.wogg.ch/wogg-75" target="_self" class="wixui-rich-text__text">THE WOGG CIRCLE</a></span></span></span></span></span></span></h2></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-mnblw2al" class="ku3DBC zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx comp-mnblw2al wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:30px; text-align:center;"><span style="letter-spacing:0.9em;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:30px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.wogg.ch/wogg-75" target="_self" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></a></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:15px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:0.25em;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></span></span><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text">WOGG arbeitet mit ausgew&auml;hlten Partnern, die Qualit&auml;t, Pr&auml;zision und Verantwortung teilen.</span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:15px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></span></span></h2>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px; text-align:center;"><span style="font-size:15px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text">Gemeinsam entstehen innovative Systeme &ndash; in Entwicklung, Produktion und Anwendung</span></span></span></span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px; text-align:center;"><span style="font-size:15px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></span></span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px; text-align:center;"><span style="font-size:15px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text">Ein Netzwerk, das auf Vertrauen basiert.</span></span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-mnbiyfey" class="ku3DBC zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx comp-mnbiyfey wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h4 class="font_4 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:13px;"><span style="letter-spacing:0.9em;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_40 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:13px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,avenir-lt-w05_35-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">KOLLEKTION</span></span></span></span></h4></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-mnbihxso" class="ku3DBC zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx comp-mnbihxso wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h4 class="font_4 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:30px;"><span style="letter-spacing:0.3em;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:30px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,avenir-lt-w05_35-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">ROLLFRONT</span></span></span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,avenir-lt-w05_35-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">KOLLEKTION</span></span></h4></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-mnbihxsv" class="ku3DBC zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx comp-mnbihxsv wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h4 class="font_4 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;"><span style="font-size:15px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,avenir-lt-w05_35-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Das patentierte System f&uuml;r Flexibilit&auml;t, Pr&auml;zision und Bewegung.</span></span></h4></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-mnbilxup" class="QrIus  comp-mnbilxup"><div class="comp-mnbilxup"><style>.comp-mnbilxup {
