x;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.wogg.ch/wogg-75" target="_self" class="wixui-rich-text__text">THE WOGG CIRCLE</a></span></span></span></span></span></span></h2>

<h2 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:30px; text-align:center;"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:30px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:0.25em;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h2>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text">WOGG arbeitet mit ausgew&auml;hlten Partnern, die Qualit&auml;t, Pr&auml;zision und Verantwortung teilen.</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text">Gemeinsam entstehen Systeme &ndash; in Entwicklung, Produktion und Anwendung</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text">Ein Netzwerk, das auf Vertrauen basiert.</span></p></div><!--/$--><div data-mesh-id="comp-l8q8ibj7inlineContent-wedge-5"></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-l8q8ibj7inlineContent-wedge-7"></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-l8q8ibj7inlineContent-wedge-11"></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-l8q8ibj7inlineContent-wedge-13"></div></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-lkzsbu30" tabindex="-1" class="Oqnisf comp-lkzsbu30 wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-lkzsbu30" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-lkzsbu30" class="MW5IWV"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LWbAav Kv1aVt"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-lkzsbu30" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-lkzsbu30" class="VgO9Yg"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-lkzsbu30inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lkzsbu30inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lkzsbu3a1" class="ku3DBC zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx comp-lkzsbu3a1 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:30px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.wogg.ch/wogg-75" target="_self" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:30px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,avenir-lt-w05_35-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">WOGG N&deg; 888 &ndash; </span></span></span><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,avenir-lt-w05_35-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">THE ROLLFRONT PATENT</span></span></span></span></a></span></h2>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text">Das patentiere Rollfrontsystem der n&auml;chsten Generation.</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text">Patent Nr. EP3910151 B1</span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-mmsxd69v" class="MazNVa comp-mmsxd69v wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="j7pOnl"><img loading="lazy" sizes="922px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/0d526f_5fd7b3acf2474866bd9a13b897fdd406~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_922,h_517,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/WOGG_75_Post_1_website-removebg.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/0d526f_5fd7b3acf2474866bd9a13b897fdd406~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_1844,h_1034,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/WOGG_75_Post_1_website-removebg.png 2x" id="img_comp-mmsxd69v" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/0d526f_5fd7b3acf2474866bd9a13b897fdd406~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_922,h_517,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/WOGG_75_Post_1_website-removebg.png" alt="WOGG_75_Post_1_website-removebg.png" style="object-fit:cover" class="BI8PVQ Tj01hh" width="922" height="517"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-mmsxc22i" class="ku3DBC zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx comp-mmsxc22i wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Entwicklungszeit</span></span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text">3 &frac12; Jahren</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Kosten</span></span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text">CHF 1.5 Mio</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Weltpremiere</span></span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:1.4em; text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><a href="https://wogg.ch/design_variations_2021/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Palazzo Litta</span></span></a></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:1.4em; text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text">Milan Design Weeks</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:1.4em; text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text">2022</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Erste Kollektion</span></span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text">WOGG N&deg; 79</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text">&nbsp;WOGG N&deg; 81</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text">WOGG N&deg; 82</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text">WOGG N&deg; 83</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text">WOGG N&deg; 84</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Winner</span></span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text">German Design Award</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text">Good Design Award</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text">IF Design Award</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text">Materialica Award</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-mmsxc22p" class="ku3DBC zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx comp-mmsxc22p wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:right; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text">Mit dem innovativen, patentierten und zukunftsweisenden Wogg No.</span><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text">&nbsp;888</span><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text">&nbsp;Rollfront System definieren wir die Grenzen des Machbaren neu. Diese Swiss Invention erm&ouml;glicht es erstmals, konkave und konvexe Radien in einer Perfektion herzustellen, die technisches Genie mit h&ouml;chster &Auml;sthetik vereint.</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:right; font-size:15px;">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:right; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text">Das System ist auf <a href="https://www.wogg.ch/wogg-75" target="_self" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Limitless Application</span></a> ausgelegt: Ein pr&auml;ziser Gleitmechanismus aus Kunststoffelementen mit weichen Gummireifen wird werkzeuglos in die Aluminiumlamellen eingeklipst. Diese patentierte Geometrie er&ouml;ffnet v&ouml;llig neue gestalterische Freiheiten im M&ouml;bel-, Bad-, K&uuml;chen- und Objektbau &ndash; &uuml;berall dort, wo Raum intelligent und elegant genutzt werden soll.</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:right; font-size:15px;"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:right; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text">Das WOGG Rollfront Patent steht ausgew&auml;hlten&nbsp;<span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.wogg.ch/outside-wogg-patent" target="_self" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Outside WOGG Patent</a>&nbsp;</span>Partnern zur&nbsp; Verf&uuml;gung.</span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-l8q8ibj71" tabindex="-1" class="Oqnisf comp-l8q8ibj71 wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-l8q8ibj71" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-l8q8ibj71" class="MW5IWV"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LWbAav Kv1aVt"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-l8q8ibj71" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-l8q8ibj71" class="VgO9Yg"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-l8q8ibj71inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-l8q8ibj71inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><section id="comp-ijslorf9" class="comp-ijslorf9 CohWsy wixui-column-strip"><div id="bgLayers_comp-ijslorf9" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-ijslorf9" class="if7Vw2"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="tcElKx i1tH8h"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-ijslorf9" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-ijslorf9" class="wG8dni"></div></div><div data-testid="columns" class="V5AUxf"><!--$--><div id="mediaisk0g6zy" class="mediaisk0g6zy YzqVVZ wixui-column-strip__column"><div id="bgLayers_mediaisk0g6zy" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER mediaisk0g6zy" class="MW5IWV"><div id="bgMedia_mediaisk0g6zy" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA mediaisk0g6zy" class="VgO9Yg"><wix-video id="videoContainer_mediaisk0g6zy" data-video-info="{&quot;fittingType&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;,&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;hasBgScrollEffect&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;bgEffectName&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;videoId&quot;: