<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_15 wixui-rich-text__text">der Badezimmer</span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lmi2h0qb" class="MazNVa comp-lmi2h0qb wixui-image" title="outside wogg patent Logo Original black."><div data-testid="linkElement" class="j7pOnl"><img loading="lazy" sizes="97px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/0d526f_114d9d1a86334bfaa7256b7c87be6f6d~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_97,h_97,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/0d526f_114d9d1a86334bfaa7256b7c87be6f6d~mv2.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/0d526f_114d9d1a86334bfaa7256b7c87be6f6d~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_194,h_194,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/0d526f_114d9d1a86334bfaa7256b7c87be6f6d~mv2.png 2x" id="img_comp-lmi2h0qb" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/0d526f_114d9d1a86334bfaa7256b7c87be6f6d~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_97,h_97,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/0d526f_114d9d1a86334bfaa7256b7c87be6f6d~mv2.png" alt="Outside Wogg Patent" style="object-fit:cover" class="BI8PVQ Tj01hh" width="97" height="97"/></div></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-mms4h5wk" class="ku3DBC zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx comp-mms4h5wk wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:30px; text-align:center;"><span style="letter-spacing:0.5em;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:30px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.wogg.ch/wogg-75" target="_self" class="wixui-rich-text__text">WOGG&ndash;&nbsp;</a></span></span></span></span><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:30px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.wogg.ch/wogg-75" target="_self" class="wixui-rich-text__text">EXELLENT DESIGN</a></span></span></span></span></span></span></h2>

<h2 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:30px; text-align:center;"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:30px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:0.25em;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h2>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text">Herausragende Projekte setzen auf die zeitlose Eleganz und Pr&auml;zision von WOGG. Mit hochwertigen Materialien und wandelbarem Design schaffen wir einzigartige R&auml;ume, die Noblesse und Funktionalit&auml;t vereinen.</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_37 wixui-rich-text__text">Ein Statement f&uuml;r Schweizer Innovation f&uuml;r anspruchsvolle Kundschaft.</span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-m7jfvpgp" class="comp-m7jfvpgp CohWsy wixui-column-strip"><div id="bgLayers_comp-m7jfvpgp" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-m7jfvpgp" class="if7Vw2"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="tcElKx i1tH8h"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-m7jfvpgp" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-m7jfvpgp" class="wG8dni"></div></div><div data-testid="columns" class="V5AUxf"><!--$--><div id="comp-m7jfvpqk" class="comp-m7jfvpqk YzqVVZ wixui-column-strip__column"><div id="bgLayers_comp-m7jfvpqk" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-m7jfvpqk" class="MW5IWV"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LWbAav Kv1aVt"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-m7jfvpqk" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-m7jfvpqk" class="VgO9Yg"><wow-image id="img_comp-m7jfvpqk" class="jhxvbR Kv1aVt dLPlxY mNGsUM bgImage" data-image-info="{&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-m7jfvpqk&quot;,&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;,&quot;targetWidth&quot;:980,&quot;targetHeight&quot;:775,&quot;isLQIP&quot;:true,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:3996,&quot;height&quot;:1970,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;0d526f_5aee515ea72e4988933a08314a62dd06~mv2.png&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;,&quot;hasAnimation&quot;:false}}" data-motion-part="BG_IMG comp-m7jfvpqk" data-bg-effect-name="" data-has-ssr-src="true"><img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/0d526f_5aee515ea72e4988933a08314a62dd06~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_49,h_24,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,blur_2,enc_avif,quality_auto/0d526f_5aee515ea72e4988933a08314a62dd06~mv2.png" alt="1.png" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 50%" width="980" height="775"/></wow-